New Order Assigned to You

Hello <%= @user.first_name || @user.email %>,

A new order has been assigned to you for processing.

Order Details:
- Order ID: #<%= @order.id.to_s.first(8) %>
- Customer: <%= @order.user.first_name || @order.user.email %>
- Product: <%= @product&.name || "N/A" %>
- Total: <%= number_to_currency(@order.total_price) %>

Items in this order:
<% @order_items.each do |item| %>
- <%= item.variant_stock_option_names || "Item" %>
  Quantity: <%= item.quantity %>
  Price: <%= number_to_currency(item.price) %>
  <% if item.variant_stock_warehouse_name %>Warehouse: <%= item.variant_stock_warehouse_name %><% end %>
<% end %>

Fulfillments:
<% @fulfillments.each do |fulfillment| %>
- Warehouse: <%= fulfillment.warehouse&.name || "N/A" %>
  Status: <%= fulfillment.status.humanize %>
  <% if fulfillment.delivery_date %>Delivery Date: <%= fulfillment.delivery_date.strftime("%B %d, %Y") %><% end %>
<% end %>

Please review this order and update its status as you process it.

View order: <%= @order_url %>

Best regards,
The Kara Bloome Team
